{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Rayfish network members use a private TLD of ".ray".

The easiest way to make these DNS lookups work is to activate the
local_unbound service and add a custom forwarder configuration with
DNSSEC validation disabled for these domains:

# /var/unbound/conf.d/rayfish.conf
server:
    domain-insecure: "ray."

forward-zone:
    name: "ray."
    forward-addr: 200::53


This IPv6 address will be respond to DNS requests when Rayfish is running.

The "ray dns on" command will automate this for you.

EOM
}
]
